    "description": "Acer TravelMate notebooks and Veriton desktops for Indian offices and schools from an Acer reseller. Quoted on request, GST invoice. Request a quote.",
    "intro": "Acer is a household name in India for consumer laptops, but its business ranges are a separate matter and are what we quote. TravelMate is the notebook family aimed at offices and institutions, and Veriton is the desktop family built for fixed desks, labs and counters. They sit at the value end of commercial hardware: sensible specifications, familiar components, and a price position that suits organisations buying in volume with a fixed budget.\n\nThat is why Acer shows up so often in education and in cost-conscious departments. A school computer lab, a college library, a municipal office or a growing company with forty new joiners all have the same problem: they need reliable machines in quantity, and the budget does not stretch to a premium tier. Acer's commercial lines are designed for that brief.\n\nTechZoid acts as an Acer reseller on a quotation basis. Acer products are not listed in our online catalogue, so there are no stock claims and no prices on this site. You send the quantity and the configuration you want, we obtain a written quotation, and the quotation is the price. Each order carries a GST invoice, which GST-registered buyers can usually claim as input credit.\n\nThe practical advantage of buying through us is consolidation. If the same order needs Windows 11 Pro, Microsoft 365 for staff, or backup software for the new machines, we can place them on one quotation and one purchase order. If you are comparing Acer with other makes, our [business laptops](/business-laptops) overview and the [HP](/brands/hp) and [Lenovo](/brands/lenovo) hubs lay out the alternatives for the same job.",
