    "slug": "lenovo",
    "displayName": "Lenovo",
    "description": "Lenovo ThinkPad, ThinkCentre and ThinkStation for Indian offices from a Lenovo reseller. Quoted to configuration, GST invoice on every order. Request a quote.",
    "intro": "Lenovo is one of the largest PC makers in the world, and in business IT it is best known for the ThinkPad notebook, the ThinkCentre desktop and the ThinkStation workstation. Those three names are what most Indian IT heads mean when they say \"Lenovo\" in a purchase discussion: machines that are specified for a fleet, imaged once and expected to run for several years without much attention.\n\nThe buyers we see asking for Lenovo in India are fairly consistent. Banks, insurers and professional-services firms standardise on ThinkPad for staff who travel. Government departments and public-sector units buy ThinkCentre desktops by the hundred for offices and labs. Engineering colleges and design studios ask for ThinkStation when a workstation has to run CAD, simulation or rendering. Smaller companies usually start with one or two ThinkPad models and grow the fleet from there.\n\nTechZoid is a Lenovo reseller, and we supply it the way we supply the rest of our hardware: by quotation. We do not hold Lenovo machines in the catalogue on this website, so there is no stock to promise and no price to show. You send us the quantity and the configuration you want, we obtain a written quotation, and the price on that document is the price. Every order carries a GST invoice, which GST-registered buyers can usually claim as input credit.\n\nBecause we also supply Microsoft licensing, the operating system, Microsoft 365 and any backup software can sit on the same quotation as the hardware. That is useful when a purchase order has to be raised once, and when the person receiving the machines wants one supplier to ask about activation. If you are comparing brands for the same tender, our [business laptops](/business-laptops) page and the [HP](/brands/hp) and [Acer](/brands/acer) hubs cover the alternatives.",
